{"metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"IncidenceMatrixModule"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"Decodable Implementations"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix\/decodable-implementations"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/Decodable-Implementations"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule","doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix"]]},"kind":"article","topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/init(from:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true}],"references":{"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule":{"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"IncidenceMatrixModule","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule"},"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule/OrientedIncidenceMatrix/init(from:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/init(from:)","title":"init(from:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix\/init(from:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Decodes the form ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"encode(to:)"},{"text":" writes, throwing ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DecodingError.dataCorrupted"},{"text":" for a negative","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertex count, storage over ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IncidenceMatrix.maximumDecodedWordCountKey"},{"text":"‘s limit (two planes’ words), a vertex","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out of range, a side not strictly ascending, or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sources"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"targets"},{"text":" of different","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lengths.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7DecoderP","text":"Decoder"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}]},"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule/OrientedIncidenceMatrix":{"title":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The oriented incidence matrix of a directed hypergraph: entry (v, p) is −1 when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"type":"text","text":" is a source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of column "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"p"},{"type":"text","text":", +1 when it is a target, and 0 otherwise. Gallo, Longo, Pallottino and Nguyen"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(1993) define a directed hypergraph’s matrix this way (aᵢⱼ = −1 for a tail node, 1 for a head"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"node); a directed graph’s edge is the column with one source and one target, the matrix of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spectral graph theory (B·Bᵀ = L